      "id": "u_e552a67b907e3114cc8cfbf1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__To the right of the note title, a temporary indicator appears after making a change to the document which shows whether the document has been saved.",
      "sourceHash": "e552a67b907e3114cc8cfbf1f6478037f73d841f9b2e51ded95171935cd9bf02",
      "context": "Save status indicator",
      "contextHash": "820c4836ffb9a30722a6706b4bd833e7ee0464bfbeab4cb384df046f71f75d16",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_125faf22de2060ce0f985aec_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "It indicates the following states:",
      "sourceHash": "125faf22de2060ce0f985aec53e9d34c63a30811dafc6955c2af56b4fe347d1c",
      "context": "Save status indicator",
      "contextHash": "820c4836ffb9a30722a6706b4bd833e7ee0464bfbeab4cb384df046f71f75d16",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0876a086a5809e1d2e06c687_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Unsaved__TRILIUM_PH_2__, if the changes will be saved soon.",
      "sourceHash": "0876a086a5809e1d2e06c6873775c2ea27269ccafe6368d4555fad263f5d36ed",
      "context": "Save status indicator",
      "contextHash": "820c4836ffb9a30722a6706b4bd833e7ee0464bfbeab4cb384df046f71f75d16",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9e8d1ce884ddfdd8aeb0588e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Saving__TRILIUM_PH_2__, if the changes are being saved.",
      "sourceHash": "9e8d1ce884ddfdd8aeb0588ec6f34030f7c1926340b9ae33c224d7f2709e2dba",
      "context": "Save status indicator",
      "contextHash": "820c4836ffb9a30722a6706b4bd833e7ee0464bfbeab4cb384df046f71f75d16",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_90f4cfb01717319cff2fb896_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Saved__TRILIUM_PH_2__, if all the changes were successfully saved to the server.",
      "sourceHash": "90f4cfb01717319cff2fb896383b5a5a9de4d1750268588195ae4d8f5971bea5",
      "context": "Save status indicator",
      "contextHash": "820c4836ffb9a30722a6706b4bd833e7ee0464bfbeab4cb384df046f71f75d16",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8312244e7265de70cc043b9a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ __TRILIUM_PH_1__Error__TRILIUM_PH_2__, if the changes could not be saved, for example due to a communication server with the server.",
      "sourceHash": "8312244e7265de70cc043b9a4539a6fd6729bd048454c56188aed4448b7955e2",
      "context": "Save status indicator",
      "contextHash": "820c4836ffb9a30722a6706b4bd833e7ee0464bfbeab4cb384df046f71f75d16",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c17dfd4058c567764a201c4b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In a text note, the changes are saved once typing pauses for a second, and at least every ten seconds while typing continues.",
      "sourceHash": "c17dfd4058c567764a201c4bfc37808c3195c821a4adabe022d62e2113acc999",
      "context": "Save status indicator",
      "contextHash": "820c4836ffb9a30722a6706b4bd833e7ee0464bfbeab4cb384df046f71f75d16",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5db60bb489663987d1832506_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "After all changes have been saved, the indicator will hide automatically after a few seconds.",
      "sourceHash": "5db60bb489663987d183250604d7b115fa434152591d6e0a65889b90d7deb402",
      "context": "Save status indicator",
      "contextHash": "820c4836ffb9a30722a6706b4bd833e7ee0464bfbeab4cb384df046f71f75d16",
